1
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:06,617
Customers choose Send me news and offers in their account.

2
00:00:06,617 --> 00:00:11,289
You can also tick Accepts marketing on a customer, under Commerce, Customers, for

3
00:00:11,289 --> 00:00:13,330
someone who agreed on the phone.

4
00:00:13,822 --> 00:00:19,172
The unsubscribe link in each email opens a page that asks the customer to confirm.

5
00:00:19,648 --> 00:00:24,431
Once they confirm, they no longer accept marketing, and no campaign or review

6
00:00:24,431 --> 00:00:25,987
request goes to them.

7
00:00:25,987 --> 00:00:29,848
They can tick Send me news and offers again in their account.

